{{Term/Store|Bird Egg|Bird Eggs|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Bird Eggs are [[Material]]s that can be found in [[Bird]]s' nests atop [[Tree]]s throughout [[Hyrule]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They are also sold at the [[East Wind]] and [[High Spirits Produce]], as well as by the travelling [[Merchant]] [[Agus]]. They can be eaten raw to restore a [[Heart]] or used as a [[Cooking]] [[Ingredient]] to make various [[Food]]s. Bird Eggs become [[Campfire Egg]]s when exposed to [[Fire]] and [[Hard-Boiled Egg]]s when dropped in [[Hot Spring]]s. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Bird Eggs can be used to make [[Yellow Dye]].

